<div class="bg-canvas min-h-screen pt-32 pb-20">
    
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <header class="container mx-auto px-6 text-center max-w-4xl mb-16">
        <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold mb-6 text-ink tracking-tight">
            Your Data. <span class="text-accent-ink">Stripped Down.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-ink/80 leading-relaxed font-light">
            Clear consent. Minimal collection. No credential custody.
        </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Content Section -->
    <section class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-2xl">
        <div class="bg-surface p-8 md:p-12 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-line space-y-10 text-ink">
            
            <p class="text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed">
                Naked Tech is a service provided by <strong>Digital Sanctum</strong>. This policy covers data collected through the Naked Tech platform. We believe in radical transparency. Here is how we handle your information.
            </p>

            <div class="space-y-4">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold flex items-center">
                    <span class="text-accent-ink mr-3">1.</span> What We Collect
                </h2>
                <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed">
                    We collect the contact and address details needed to respond, assess suitability and deliver the booked service, plus concise service notes needed for the agreed work. Payment details are processed securely by Stripe; Naked Tech does not receive your full card number.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-4">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold flex items-center">
                    <span class="text-accent-ink mr-3">2.</span> What We Don't Do
                </h2>
                <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed">
                    We do not sell your data, install spyware or inspect personal files without a service reason and your knowledge. Do not send passwords, authentication codes, recovery details or sensitive financial information through an enquiry form.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-4">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold flex items-center">
                    <span class="text-accent-ink mr-3">3.</span> Credentials During a Visit
                </h2>
                <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed">
                    You enter device, Wi-Fi, account and password-manager credentials yourself wherever they are needed. Naked Tech does not record, photograph, copy, transmit or retain your passwords, authentication codes or recovery material, and customer credentials are never placed in our own password manager.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-4">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold flex items-center">
                    <span class="text-accent-ink mr-3">4.</span> Our Security
                </h2>
                <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed">
                    We use protected business accounts, encrypted communication where appropriate and access controls for the information required to run the service. We retain only what is operationally or legally necessary and review access when it is no longer required.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="pt-6 border-t border-line">
                <p class="text-muted italic">
                    Questions? Email <a href="mailto:privacy@nakedtech.au" class="text-accent-ink hover:underline font-bold">privacy@nakedtech.au</a>
                </p>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

</div>
